WEBVTT

NOTE LUMO, The Gospel of Luke 8:40-9:17 (Arclight 6_GOLuke2609), en.
NOTE Timings: whisper.cpp small -dtw small per speech burst on the isolated dialogue (dialoguenhance centre channel), first word on the burst start, 2026-10-23.

1
00:01:33.750 --> 00:01:35.400
While Jesus was still speaking,

2
00:01:35.500 --> 00:01:38.450
someone came from the house of Jairus, the synagogue leader.

3
00:01:42.050 --> 00:01:44.170
Your daughter is dead, he said.

4
00:01:44.270 --> 00:01:47.700
Don't bother the teacher anymore.

5
00:01:48.050 --> 00:01:52.150
Hearing this, Jesus said to Jairus,

6
00:01:52.450 --> 00:01:56.550
Don't be afraid; just believe, and she will be healed.

7
00:01:57.250 --> 00:01:59.100
When he arrived at the house of Jairus,

8
00:01:59.500 --> 00:02:01.790
he did not let anyone go in with him

9
00:02:01.890 --> 00:02:06.400
except Peter, John and James, and the child's father and mother.

10
00:02:07.100 --> 00:02:11.040
Meanwhile, all the people were wailing and mourning for her.

11
00:02:11.140 --> 00:02:12.800
Stop wailing, Jesus said.

12
00:02:13.400 --> 00:02:16.380
She is not dead but asleep.

13
00:02:16.700 --> 00:02:19.600
They laughed at him, knowing that she was dead.

14
00:02:20.650 --> 00:02:22.350
But he took her by the hand and said,

15
00:02:23.550 --> 00:02:25.500
My child, get up!

16
00:03:09.350 --> 00:03:10.600
Her spirit returned,

17
00:03:11.050 --> 00:03:12.800
and at once she stood up.

18
00:03:17.350 --> 00:03:20.240
Then Jesus told them to give her something to eat.

19
00:03:20.900 --> 00:03:22.450
Her parents were astonished,

20
00:03:23.200 --> 00:03:25.900
but he ordered them not to tell anyone what had happened.
